            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.46.1+GEN.46.2+GEN.46.3+GEN.46.4+GEN.46.5+GEN.46.6+GEN.46.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 46:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man amio Yakobo kud Esau, ni Isak: man amio got Seir ni Esau, kara emwonye; man Yakobo giku nyithindho pare giloro piny i Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Ai 3:1-12:42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aoro Musa giku Harun, man agoyo Misiri, calku maeno m’atimo i kinde: man yo ku ng’eye awodhowu woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.1+EXO.14.2+EXO.14.3+EXO.14.4+EXO.14.5+EXO.14.6+EXO.14.7+EXO.14.8+EXO.14.9+EXO.14.10+EXO.14.11+EXO.14.12+EXO.14.13+EXO.14.14+EXO.14.15+EXO.14.16+EXO.14.17+EXO.14.18+EXO.14.19+EXO.14.20+EXO.14.21+EXO.14.22+EXO.14.23+EXO.14.24+EXO.14.25+EXO.14.26+EXO.14.27+EXO.14.28+EXO.14.29+EXO.14.30+EXO.14.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 14:1-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man awodho kwaruwu woko kud i Misiri: e wuwok dhu nam; man Jumisiri gilubo tok kwaruwu ku magali man ku weg riuni cil kum Nam Makwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kinde ma gilwong’o Yehova, eketho mudho i kindwu wuku Jumisiri, man ekelo nam i wigi, e eumogi; man weng’wu neno gin m’atimo i Misiri: e wubedo i yamba ceng’ dupa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 21:21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man akelowu i ng’om mi Juamori, m’ubedo loka Yordan: e gikiedo kudu; man amiogi i cingwu, man wumwonyo ng’om migi: man anyothogi kud i weng’wu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Wel 22:1-24:25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balak ma wod Zipor, m’ubimo mi Moab, elund eai man ekiedo kum Israel: man eoro elwong’o Balam ma wod Beor kara ekwong’wu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento ayio ngo awinj Balam; ka kumeno emio mugisa iwu asu: kum kumeno abodhowu kud i cinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.3.14+JOS.3.15+JOS.3.16+JOS.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoc 3:14-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.6.1+JOS.6.2+JOS.6.3+JOS.6.4+JOS.6.5+JOS.6.6+JOS.6.7+JOS.6.8+JOS.6.9+JOS.6.10+JOS.6.11+JOS.6.12+JOS.6.13+JOS.6.14+JOS.6.15+JOS.6.16+JOS.6.17+JOS.6.18+JOS.6.19+JOS.6.20+JOS.6.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoc 6:1-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E wucidho loka Yordan; man wuwok kum Yeriko; man dhanu m’i Yeriko gikiedo kudu, gi Jaamori, man Japerizi, ku Jakanani, man Jahiti, ku Jagirgaci, man Jahivi, man Jayebusi; man amiogi i cingwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 23:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 7:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aoro pino i weng’wu, m’uriemogi woko kud i weng’wu, gin ubimo ario mi Juamori; ku palamularu peri ngo, kadi kud atum peri de ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 6:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man amio iwu ng’om ma wumulu ku tic ungo i wie, man adhura ma wugomo wun ungo, e wubedo i ie; man wucamu kum podho ulok man podho ulam ma wupidho wun ungo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
