          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Eleazar ma wod Harun utho; man giyike i ungulu got pa Finehaz ma wode, ma jumio ire i ng’om gudi pa Efraim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.33",
